--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Plannotation depends on, but does not include or modify, the following third-party
packages. Each remains under its own licence; see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the
current audited list.

Weak-copyleft dependencies are used as unmodified, dynamically imported libraries
only, consistent with the project's licence policy:

  * ifcopenshell  -- LGPL-3.0-or-later (unmodified dependency)
  * CairoSVG      -- LGPL-3.0-or-later (unmodified dependency)

Strong-copyleft tools are invoked, when present, only as external command-line
programs over a process boundary. They are never linked or imported, and they are
always optional -- Plannotation degrades gracefully when they are absent:

  * veraPDF   -- GPL-3.0 / MPL-2.0 dual-licensed (optional external CLI)
  * Inkscape  -- GPL-3.0 (optional external CLI)
  * ocrmypdf / tesseract -- GPL-3.0 / Apache-2.0 (optional external CLI)

Plannotation deliberately does NOT depend on PyMuPDF (AGPL-3.0) or any other
AGPL-licensed component.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Example drawings
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`make examples` draws sheets from third-party IFC models, which it downloads and
which are not included in this repository or its distributions. The drawings are
adaptations of those models and carry their credit:

  * Maleva 18 seniors' apartment building, Tallinn. IFC model (c) Esplan OÜ
    (esplan.ee), CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), via
    buildingSMART Community Sample Test Files. Drawings rendered and annotated
    from the model by Plannotation (changes made). Not an Esplan drawing.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Normative references
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Plannotation specification builds on, and credits, the following prior work. No
text from these sources is reproduced in this repository.

  * ISO 32000-2 (PDF 2.0) -- Associated Files and the /AF mechanism.
  * ISO 19005-4:2020 (PDF/A-4f) -- embedded files of arbitrary type.
  * PDF Declarations (PDF Association, 2019) -- the XMP conformance declaration.
  * IfcOpenShell SVG serializer conventions (v0.8) -- product ids, classes and
    view-transform attributes, reused unchanged.
  * SWAPP ifc-docs (CC0, 2024) -- DocumentSet / Sheet / ViewPort / View /
    Annotation vocabulary, reused where it already names a concept.
  * buildingSMART IFC -- all class names, GlobalIds and property-set names.
